{"corpus":"ccc","number":2750,"text_html":"<span>C’est en entrant dans le saint Nom du Seigneur Jésus que nous pouvons accueillir, du dedans, la prière qu’il nous apprend : « Notre Père ! ». Sa prière sacerdotale inspire, du dedans, les grandes demandes<sup class=\"srcRef cccRef\">§2815</sup> du Pater : le souci du Nom du Père <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"1\">1</sup><sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"2\">2</sup><sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"3\">3</sup><sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"4\">4</sup>, la passion de son Règne <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"5\">5</sup><sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"6\">6</sup><sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"7\">7</sup><sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"8\">8</sup><sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"9\">9</sup>, l’accomplissement de la volonté du Père, de son Dessein de salut <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"10\">10</sup> et la libération du mal <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"11\">11</sup>.</span>","cross_refs":["2815"],"bible_refs":[{"text":"Jn 17:6"},{"text":"Jn 17:11"},{"text":"Jn 17:12"},{"text":"Jn 17:26"},{"text":"Jn 17:1"},{"text":"Jn 17:5"},{"text":"Jn 17:10"},{"text":"Jn 17:24"},{"text":"Jn 17:23-26"},{"text":"Jn 17:2"},{"text":"Jn 17:15"}],"citations":[],"magisterial_refs":[{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Jn 17:6","idx":1},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"17:11","idx":2},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"17:12","idx":3},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"17:26","idx":4},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Jn 17:1","idx":5},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"17:5","idx":6},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"17:10","idx":7},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"17:24","idx":8},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"17:23-26","idx":9},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Jn 17:2 . 4. 6. 9. 11. 12. 24","idx":10},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Jn 17:15","idx":11}]}